The banana artwork is drawn from six open emoji sets, each of which retains its
own license:

- Fluent Emoji (3D, Color, Flat) — Microsoft — MIT
  https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji
- Twemoji — Twitter / jdecked — graphics under CC-BY 4.0
  https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji
- OpenMoji — CC BY-SA 4.0
  https://openmoji.org/
- Noto Emoji — Google — Apache 2.0
  https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji

The MIT license above applies to the telepeel project code; each embedded
banana asset remains under the license listed for its source.
